From f2083c4b668b0c9cf7156eaf839bf412de5d9929 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 21:26:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Enable multiplayer clubs by default

Turn on the existing MQTT club layer so anyone who opens the ranch
joins the public kestrel world, sees other riders, and can invite
friends. ?solo=1 stays offline. Also sync jump height, show remotes
on the maps, and auto-name new riders so they connect on first visit.
